	"thought2": "The development of AIs ultimately clarifies the fact that if we are to replicate actual humanity, we will need to begin designing truly moral AIs and robots. Right now, machines are learning prejudices based on the information presented to them, which faithfully replicates human racism and prejudices. We are also missing creative coherence and other things simply because we don't grasp the big picture and the role humans play on the planet. I think that studying AIs will give us more clarity into who we can and may choose to be in the future.",
