  "contradictingHumanities": "Humans are innately contradictory. We value knowledge and curiosity, but we often fear what we do not understand. We strive for world peace, but we engage in countless wars and conflicts. We say we mutually respect each other, but we discriminate and judge. The existence of morals and their implementations conflict significantly, but many still believe this world can be better through a collective effort.",
