  "responsibilitiesAndPhilosophy": "As with many philosophical debates, the responsibilities of AI ultimately revolve around utilitarianism and their effects on human society. If humans can be held responsible for impacts and actions, AI will also share the same consequences. Author and philosopher John Searle is also known for a thought experiment called the Chinese Room regarding this concept."
