  "thought_3": "If AI attains higher creative abilities than humans, like being able to physically create rather than mess around with what they are programmed to do, then we're in trouble. Luckily, a day like that seems to be further down the line and poses no threat currently. Furthermore, without higher instinct and self-awareness we at least have some handle on what to make of AI or how to adapt to their presence."
